    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Hiroshi Nohara's Lunch Style",
        "jpn": "野原ひろし 昼メシの流儀"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The story focuses on Hiroshi Nohara, Shin-chan's father and the head of the Nohara family. As a 35-year-old salaryman, he has limited time and money to spend on food, which shapes his choice of lunchtime. Throughout the manga, Hiroshi describes the food, delivers food trivia, and gripes about workplace woes, such as having to treat his seniors to food, sudden workloads shortening his lunch break, and hated bosses.",
        "jpn": "「クレヨンしんちゃん」シリーズでは描かれていない、サラリーマンとして家族のために働くひろしの束の間の息抜き＝昼メシを、限られたお小遣いと時間の中でこだわりにこだわり抜く姿＜昼メシの流儀＞を描き。"
    },
